1
00:00:01,079 --> 00:00:06,240
Come here.
Ow—

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:09,804
Tell me. What the hell were you
doing in *that* room?

3
00:00:09,804 --> 00:00:15,719
What? I just… happened to
run into P'Night.

4
00:00:15,939 --> 00:00:21,794
Happened to? I've known Night for years—
never once “happened” to run into him, dumbass.

5
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,866
Why are you avoiding my eyes?

6
00:00:26,866 --> 00:00:31,642
I'm not. I just… don't want to look at you.

7
00:00:31,843 --> 00:00:38,123
And where are your clothes?
Don't say "at the laundry."

8
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:43,239
I was tired, I went to work,
then stayed at Tawan's.

9
00:00:43,239 --> 00:00:46,999
Lies. What the hell happened last night?
Tell me everything.

10
00:00:48,768 --> 00:00:51,000
Everything… what?

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,679
Night said you guys dragged me
back to my room and—

12
00:00:59,448 --> 00:01:04,096
So who the hell was the one…
who slept with me?

13
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,949
Who do you mean?

14
00:01:11,688 --> 00:01:13,749
The one who slept with me last night.

15
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:21,680
Wasn't it you?

16
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:36,000
If I remembered, would I be asking you?

17
00:01:38,040 --> 00:01:40,477
I don't know…
you got mad at me.

18
00:01:40,701 --> 00:01:45,320
You yelled at me for stopping you from fighting
in the club. Then you cursed at my mom, so I—

19
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:48,000
—so I packed my stuff and came here.

20
00:01:49,007 --> 00:01:52,854
I… I cursed at your mom?

21
00:01:54,022 --> 00:01:55,401
What did I say?

22
00:01:56,609 --> 00:01:59,870
I'm not repeating it.
Saying it again is like cursing my own mom.

23
00:02:01,041 --> 00:02:04,014
That's it?
You couldn't just tell me?

24
00:02:05,725 --> 00:02:08,460
I didn't want to say it. Move—
you're suffocating me.

25
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:11,290
Earth! Hey—
